# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# SockAcademy — Environment Variables Reference
# Copy to .env and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env to git.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Shopify ──────────────────────────────────────
SHOPIFY_SHOP_DOMAIN=your-store.myshopify.com
SHOPIFY_MASTER_TOKEN=shpat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
SHOPIFY_THEME_ID=000000000000          # Admin → Online Store → Themes → ... → Edit code (URL contains theme ID)
BLOG_ID=0000000000000                  # Admin → Online Store → Blog Posts (ID in URL)

# ── Anthropic ────────────────────────────────────
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── OpenAI (DALL-E / gpt-image-1) ───────────────
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── Meta / Instagram ─────────────────────────────
META_ACCESS_TOKEN=EAAxxxxxxxxxxxx
META_AD_ACCOUNT_ID=act_xxxxxxxxxxxx
META_PAGE_ID=0000000000000
META_IG_USER_ID=0000000000000

# ── Klaviyo ──────────────────────────────────────
KLAVIYO_PRIVATE_API_KEY=pk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx   # Settings → API Keys → Private API Key

# ── CJ Dropshipping ──────────────────────────────
CJ_API_KEY=CJxxxxxxxx@api@xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
CJ_EMAIL=your@email.com

# ── Spocket (A1 — optional, graceful no-op if unset) ──
SPOCKET_API_KEY=sp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── Google (Sheets + Drive) ──────────────────────
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON={"type":"service_account","project_id":"..."}   # Full SA JSON
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
GDRIVE_BACKUP_FOLDER_ID=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx   # Google Drive folder for A5 image backups

# ── Gmail SMTP ───────────────────────────────────
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx   # Google Account → Security → App Passwords

# ── Perplexity (A13 Competitive Intelligence) ────
PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=pplx-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx   # perplexity.ai → API → Keys

# ── Pricing Guards ───────────────────────────────
MARKUP_MULTIPLIER=2.5
PRICE_WARN_PCT=0.10
PRICE_CRITICAL_PCT=0.20
STOCK_LOW_THRESHOLD=5

# ── CFO / Finance ────────────────────────────────
VAT_RATE=0.17                   # ישראל: 17% | EU: varies | US: 0 (sales tax separate)
TAX_JURISDICTION=IL             # IL | US | EU
ENTITY_TYPE=SOLE_PROPRIETOR     # SOLE_PROPRIETOR | LLC | LTD
ADMIN_EMAIL=guyoved102@gmail.com

# ── GitHub Actions (injected automatically) ──────
# GITHUB_TOKEN is auto-provided — do not set manually
